---
// path: src/pages/maintenance.astro
import PublicLayout from '../layouts/PublicLayout.astro';
---

<PublicLayout title="Pemeliharaan Sistem">
  <main class="flex-grow flex items-center justify-center py-stack-lg relative">
    <!-- Background pattern (pseudo-layer, not affecting content opacity) -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-pattern pointer-events-none"></div>
    <!-- Background decorative -->
    <div class="absolute top-1/4 left-10 w-64 h-64 border-2 border-primary/10 rounded-full animate-pulse"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-1/4 right-10 w-48 h-48 border border-secondary/20 rotate-45"></div>

    <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-4 w-full flex flex-col items-center">
      <!-- Bento Grid -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-6 w-full max-w-4xl">
        <!-- Hero Card -->
        <div class="md:col-span-12 bg-white rounded-xl border border-outline-variant shadow-[0_0_40px_-10px_rgba(0,77,39,0.15)] overflow-hidden flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center p-8 gap-8">
          <div class="w-full md:w-1/2 flex justify-center" style="animation: float 4s ease-in-out infinite;">
            <div class="relative w-64 h-64 md:w-80 md:h-80 flex items-center justify-center">
              <div class="bg-primary/5 rounded-full p-12">
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[100px] text-primary/30">build</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="w-full md:w-1/2 text-center md:text-left space-y-4">
            <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-secondary-container text-on-secondary-container text-sm font-semibold tracking-wider">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">build</span>
              SISTEM SEDANG DIPERBARUI
            </div>
            <h1 class="text-[32px] md:text-[48px] font-bold font-[Montserrat] text-primary leading-tight">Optimalisasi Layanan Digital</h1>
            <p class="text-on-surface-variant text-lg leading-relaxed">
              Sistem sedang dalam pemeliharaan rutin untuk meningkatkan layanan bagi mahasiswa. Kami sedang bekerja keras memastikan proses pendaftaran beasiswa Anda lebih lancar dan aman.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Status Card -->
        <div class="md:col-span-7 bg-white rounded-xl border border-outline-variant p-6 flex flex-col justify-center items-center text-center">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-5xl text-primary/30 mb-4">schedule</span>
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-wider text-on-surface-variant mb-2">ESTIMASI PENYELESAIAN</p>
          <p class="text-lg font-bold font-[Montserrat] text-primary">Sampai Waktu yang Tidak Dapat Ditentukan</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-on-surface-variant text-sm">Tim teknis sedang bekerja. Mohon periksa kembali secara berkala.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Contact Card -->
        <div class="md:col-span-5 bg-primary text-on-primary rounded-xl p-6 flex flex-col gap-4">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-primary-container flex items-center justify-center">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined" style="font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;">contact_support</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-2xl font-[Montserrat]">Kontak Bantuan</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-on-primary/80 text-sm">
            Jika ada kendala mendesak terkait berkas pendaftaran, silakan hubungi tim administrasi kami melalui:
          </p>
          <div class="space-y-3">
            <a href="mailto:humas@iainptk.ac.id" class="flex items-center gap-3 hover:bg-white/10 p-2 rounded-lg transition-colors group">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary-fixed">mail</span>
              <span class="text-sm">humas@iainptk.ac.id</span>
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined ml-auto text-sm opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity">open_in_new</span>
            </a>
            <a href="tel:+62561740601" class="flex items-center gap-3 hover:bg-white/10 p-2 rounded-lg transition-colors group">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary-fixed">call</span>
              <span class="text-sm">(0561) 740601</span>
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined ml-auto text-sm opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity">open_in_new</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Footer message -->
      <div class="mt-stack-lg text-center max-w-lg">
        <p class="text-on-surface-variant text-sm font-semibold tracking-wider italic">
          Terima kasih atas kesabaran Anda. Kami berkomitmen memberikan pengalaman digital terbaik bagi civitas akademika IAIN Pontianak.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</PublicLayout>

<style>
  @keyframes float {
    0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0px); }
    50% { transform: translateY(-10px); }
  }
</style>


